Package: cmgr
Type: Package
Title: Two-Way Fixed-Effect Projection with Combinatorial Multigrid
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: person("Johannes", "Schmieder", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "johannes@bu.edu")
Description: An experimental native interface to the CMG graph solver for
    weighted projection on two categorical fixed effects. Provides batch
    residualization and an opt-in adapter for the companion fixest branch.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/johannes-schmieder/CMG/tree/main/cmgr
BugReports: https://github.com/johannes-schmieder/CMG/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Rust (>= 1.85), Cargo, C compiler
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests: fixest
